\_form#0=186x13:$command  = p_{term} + i_{term} + d_{term} $
\_form#1=116x10:$ p_{term}  = p_{gain} * p_{error} $
\_form#2=189x15:$ i_{term}  = i_{term} + \int{i_{gain} * p_{error} * dt} $
\_form#3=116x14:$ d_{term}  = d_{gain} * d_{error} $
\_form#4=170x14:$ d_{error} = (p_{error} - p_{error last}) / dt $
\_form#5=133x9:$ p_{error}  = p_{desired} - p_{state} $
