\_form#7=14x9:$\omega_1$
\_form#8=14x9:$\omega_2$
\_form#9=10x9:$T$
\_form#10=141x16:$s(n) = A \sin [ K(e^{\delta t/L} - 1) ]$
\_form#11=54x23:$K = \frac{\omega_1T}{\ln \frac{\omega_2}{\omega_1} }$
\_form#12=50x21:$L = \frac{T}{\ln \frac{\omega_2}{\omega_1} }$
